1
00:00:00,854 --> 00:00:03,512
Tonight, you go to bed for the last time.

2
00:00:04,315 --> 00:00:06,868
Tomorrow, every human wakes up

3
00:00:06,888 --> 00:00:10,418
and discovers that sleep is simply unnecessary.

4
00:00:11,223 --> 00:00:12,268
No fatigue.

5
00:00:12,358 --> 00:00:13,633
No brain fog.

6
00:00:13,736 --> 00:00:15,432
No hidden health cost.

7
00:00:16,148 --> 00:00:19,106
Whatever your body used to repair during sleep

8
00:00:19,126 --> 00:00:21,706
now happens while you are awake.

9
00:00:22,719 --> 00:00:26,581
You just gained roughly eight extra hours every day.
